h to be in the street it's not  enough we were in the street what is  next has to happen is that we have to  make culture we have to extend culture  we have to talk culture because that's  what lives  that's what guarantees that's when  shrines what we do and I love these  activists majority of them because they  are actually first of all they're  leaderless which i think is the most  powerful statement they can be we don't  need any leaders for this and also at  the same time they are making culture as  they move let's preserve it because  there will be people behind us let's  make it let's talk about it let's show  it so that we can talk not only to our  own time but to the time after this  because we don't those statues will be  erected again because people will forget  thank you very much for being on the  program  Bonnie gray a very interesting take from  you and what we've seen in recent weeks  thank you thank you
 

